1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,940
Back in that treatment chair, I close my eyes and see

2
00:00:03,940 --> 00:00:07,540
A hammock and a palm tree swaying out by the sea

3
00:00:07,540 --> 00:00:11,060
I'd ask the nurse for pineapple and an umbrella in my cup

4
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:13,060
She'd laugh and call me, call me crazy

5
00:00:13,060 --> 00:00:14,580
I'd say, "Hey, it keeps me up"

6
00:00:14,580 --> 00:00:18,180
Now my feet can't feel the sand the way they did before

7
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:22,180
But I can feel the sunshine, and I can hear the shore

8
00:00:22,180 --> 00:00:25,380
And every single morning that I open up my eyes

9
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:28,820
Is a little piece of paradise I didn't plan to find

10
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:32,580
So don't you rush me, don't you hurry me along

11
00:00:32,580 --> 00:00:37,060
Every slow sunset is a brand new song

12
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:40,420
I'm living on island time

13
00:00:40,420 --> 00:00:43,780
Where the sunsets keep the score

14
00:00:43,780 --> 00:00:46,420
Ain't no clock up on the wall

15
00:00:47,300 --> 00:00:50,020
And no calendar on the door

16
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:53,940
Every wave says, "Slow it down"

17
00:00:54,420 --> 00:00:58,620
Every breeze says, "Stay a while"

18
00:00:58,620 --> 00:01:02,380
I'm on island time

19
00:01:02,380 --> 00:01:05,180
Counting days in smiles

20
00:01:05,180 --> 00:01:05,950
Slow it down
